OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable cloud with showers
OL,6,Fcontinuing to feed across eastern
OL,7,Fcounties and giving the odd heavier
OL,8,Fone. Mostly dry further west with
OL,9,Foccasional bright intervals. Breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially around the coast, giving a
OL,11,Fchilly feel.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOften rather cloudy with
OL,14,Fisolated showers at first, although
OL,15,Ftending to become largely dry. A brisk
OL,16,Fbreeze persisting around the coast, a
OL,17,Flittle lighter inland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
